<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended sharply lower in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 148.36 to 6391.69 For the week, the Dow fell 134.38 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 9.89 to 389.47.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $1.00.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 2322 to 379.</p>
<p>Volume was 440,478,650 compared with 421,795,670 on Thursday. Weekly volume totalled 2,240,418,650 shares.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
